o Payment methods (continued)
-----------------------------

- "How about NetCash?"
     Unfortunately, NetCash incurs a horrific 20 percent surcharge any time
     someone wishes to convert it back to cold hard cash, and since humans 
     can't live on packets alone (though we've tried), this would be inevitable.

- "How about just billing me?"
     We simply don't have the staff to handle the headaches of billing.
     Electronic billing allows us to remain small, efficient, and focus on 
     those things we know most. We hope you agree.
